{"ticker":{"symbol":"SQFT","name":"Presidio Property Trust, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":0.8,"change_pct":-0.036144578313252906,"market_cap":1147545.0,"pe":-2.3529413,"pb":0.06931208,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.725,"week52_high":5.44,"sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Diversified","country":"United States","city":"San Diego","employees":15,"website":"https://www.presidiopt.com","business_summary":"Presidio Property Trust, Inc. is an internally managed, diversified REIT with holdings in model home properties which are triple net leased to homebuilders, office, industrial, and retail properties. Presidio's model homes are leased to homebuilders located primarily in the sun belt states. Presidio's office, industrial, and retail properties are located primarily in Colorado, with properties also located in Maryland, North Dakota, Texas, and Southern California. Presidio Property Trust, Inc. was incorporated on September 28th, 1999 in Maryland and is based in San Diego, California.","business_summary_ko":"Presidio Property Trust, Inc.는 주택 건축업자, 사무실, 산업 및 소매 부동산에 대한 삼중 순 임대 임대인 모델 주택 부동산을 보유하고 있는 내부 관리형 다각화된 REIT입니다. Presidio의 모델 주택은 주로 선벨트 주에 위치한 주택 건설업자에게 임대됩니다. Presidio의 사무실, 산업 및 소매 부동산은 주로 콜로라도에 위치하고 있으며 메릴랜드, 노스다코타, 텍사스 및 남부 캘리포니아에도 부동산이 있습니다. Presidio Property Trust, Inc.는 1999년 9월 28일 메릴랜드에서 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 샌디에이고에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"REIT - 다각화","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":17764281.0,"operating_income":294054.0,"net_income":-6736371.0,"eps":-5.7},{"period":"2023","revenue":17635614.0,"operating_income":-543475.0,"net_income":8027600.0,"eps":6.8},{"period":"2024","revenue":18925275.0,"operating_income":-372995.0,"net_income":-27865225.0,"eps":-22.5},{"period":"2025","revenue":16814708.0,"operating_income":89559.0,"net